    "{\"supported\":false,\"issues\":[\"Finding_id: none (top-level answer). The sentence 'הזיהוי ... הוא של TRK-781 ולא של T015I' asserts a negative identity. The radar record shows target_id TRK-781, but radar observations need not carry the exercise identifier (system_catalog L9). The answer should say only that no T015I label appears and that identity is unconfirmed.\",\"Finding_id: none (top-level answer). The claim that TRK-781 was identified 'רק לפי מיקום וזמן' is cited only to [sniffer.csv:L393], which shows the target label and position but not how identity was matched. Add the supporting basis: [calc:region:case_005:2] (position and time matching without target-ID filtering) and/or [system_catalog.txt:L9] (a spatial match is not independent identity confirmation).\",\"Finding_id: none (top-level answer). 'עד אז המצב האפקטיבי הראה את החסימה פעילה' is cited only to [sniffer.csv:L349], a single snapshot valid 12:07:10–12:07:15 UTC. It does not establish that SEC-7 was enabled throughout the earlier period. Cite the interval evidence (for example the inhibit-interval records or the calc:region inhibit intervals) or limit the claim to the 12:07:10 snapshot.\"]}",
